#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "GatewayKit Pro – Payment Gateway for Elementor Forms"
msgstr "GatewayKit Pro – Payment Gateway for Elementor Forms"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "https://pourmirzai.com/gatewaykit"
msgstr "https://pourmirzai.com/gatewaykit"

#. Description of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "Add-on for GatewayKit. Unlocks advanced Pro features: discount codes, advanced transaction log, per-form redirects, partial payments, currency selector, outgoing webhooks, and white-label branding. All payment gateways (Stripe, Mollie, CoinGate, Coinify, PayPal, NOWPayments) are now included in the free GatewayKit."
msgstr "Complemento para GatewayKit. Desbloqueia recursos avançados do Pro: códigos de desconto, registro avançado de transações, redirecionamentos por formulário, pagamentos parciais, seletor de moeda, webhooks de saída e branding white-label. Todas as gateways de pagamento (Stripe, Mollie, CoinGate, Coinify, PayPal, NOWPayments) agora estão incluídas no GatewayKit gratuito."

#. Author of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "Morteza Pourmirzai"
msgstr "Morteza Pourmirzai"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "https://pourmirzai.com"
msgstr "https://pourmirzai.com"

